 "about_text": "Von Lintel Gallery is a commercial gallery founded by Tarrah von Lintel, who opened her first space in Munich in 1993 before relocating to New York's Chelsea district in 1999 and later to Los Angeles. The gallery represents a select roster of artists working primarily in painting, photography, and unique works on paper, with a particular emphasis on experimental and camera-less photographic processes. Its artists' work appears in major public collections including The Metropolitan Museum of Art, MoMA, the Whitney, and LACMA. The gallery is a member of the Art Dealers Association of America, and Tarrah von Lintel serves on its board.",
